{"id":"422d9b41ae960a38","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-arithmetized-completeness.md","title":"Arithmetized Completeness","display":"thm-arithmetized-completeness — Arithmetized Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-arithmetized-completeness","aliases":["67-thm-arithmetized-completeness"],"display":"thm-arithmetized-completeness — Arithmetized Completeness","depends_on":["[[67-df-numeration]]","[[67-df-formula-provability]]","[[67-df-interpretability]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-certified-proof]]","[[67-df-proof-representation]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 4，印刷页 77–80；PDF 第 88–91 页","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"已核对陈述并阅读原书 Henkin 构造草图；原书略去完整算术化细节，本次未补齐","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-arithmetized-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-arithmetized-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arithmetized-completeness — Arithmetized Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 4，印刷页 77–80；PDF 第 88–91 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"已核对陈述并阅读原书 Henkin 构造草图；原书略去完整算术化细节，本次未补齐"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致、原始递归公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>；使用本册语法与证明算术化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为固定标准编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(z)\">\\(\\sigma(z)\\)</span> 为至多自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 的算术公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\sigma,g[S])\">\\(\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\sigma,g[S])\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>。目标扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\}\">\\(T\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\}\\)</span> 不额外假设一致。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\sigma,g[S])\n\\Longrightarrow\nS\\unlhd\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\sigma,g[S])\n\\Longrightarrow\nS\\unlhd\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>这是本章后续存在性构造的核心工具。原书先算术化 Henkin 完备扩张，构造一个由公式定义的模型，再从该模型取得相对解释。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中可证，结论立即给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd T\">\\(S\\unlhd T\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这里要求的是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中 numerates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，不是要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 已经是某个固定的 PR 公理谓词。原书明确将证明称为 informal outline；已读印刷页 77–80 的草图，不把这项来源记录当作补齐了算术化证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 Cambridge/ASL 2016 重印本 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Theorem 4，印刷页 77–80；PDF 第 88–91 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对陈述并阅读原书 Henkin 构造草图；原书略去完整算术化细节，本次未补齐。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-numeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","locati