e},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S\\unlhd T","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":2996,"backlinks":[{"id":"916ea8724331b0a4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f2048e5139e9d29b","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源证明两方向已读：解释的每个有限源片段落入有限目标片段，有限一致性转移再用 PA 扩张的反身性。反向取 PR 双表示 $\\sigma$，构造 $\\sigma^*(x)=\\sigma(x)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma\\upharpoonright x}$；Lemma 3 保证它仍双表示 $S$ 且 PA 证明其一致性，随后用算术化完备性 [[67-thm-arithmetized-completeness]] 得解释。任意公式表示下的内部一致性及 $\\sigma\\upharpoonright x$ 现在显式引用 [[67-df-formula-provability]]，截断采用原书 $z\\le x$。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-arithmetized-completeness]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-relative-interpretation]]；[[../67-df-faithful-interpretability]]；[[../67-lem-orey-hajek]]；[[../67-thm-orey-compactness]]；[[../67-thm-interpretability-pi1]]；[[../67-df-formula-provability]]；[[../67-thm-arithmetized-completeness]]；[[../67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration]]；[[../67-thm-faithful-interpretability-criterion]]"}],"outgoing":["9c200c8ec3685766","1e05755479add015","44cd21d3d12e4d8d","cd051851df5d2aa2","a329235da6144513","189f5355af0e487c","3fa0d0f598b791bc"]}